{"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents22MISONavigationListItemV","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISONavigationListItem","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MISONavigationListItem","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISONavigationListItem","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem\/init(data:indicatorType:leading:trailing:action:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem\/body"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem\/View-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISONavigationListItem"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Navigations"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem","type":"reference"},{"text":" is an interactive variant of the list item that triggers an action when tapped.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It displays a navigation indicator (chevron for next\/previous, or an external link icon)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to communicate the type of navigation to the user."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The item typically contains a label, and optionally a description, an overline, an extra label,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a text slot, a bottom slot, and a helper text — all provided through ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can also include an optional leading element (such as an icon, image, avatar, flag or custom view)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and an optional trailing element (such as a text, badge, tag, icon, image, avatar, flag or custom view)","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For non-interactive, display-only list items, see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOStaticListItem"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Indicator-types","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Indicator types"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItemIndicatorType","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" enum defines the visual indicator and semantic meaning of the navigation:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".next"}]},{"text":" (default): A forward chevron indicating in-app navigation to a next screen.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".previous"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A backward chevron indicating in-app navigation to a previous screen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"When using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".previous"},{"text":", the leading element is automatically hidden.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".external"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": An external link icon indicating that the action opens content outside the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(e.g. a URL in a browser or an external viewer).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Simple navigable list item with forward navigation","    MISONavigationListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(label: \"Next screen\")","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to next screen","    }","","    \/\/ List item with external navigation","    MISONavigationListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(label: \"Open website\"),","        indicatorType: .external","    ) {","        openURL(url)","    }","","    \/\/ List item with backward navigation","    MISONavigationListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(label: \"Go back\"),","        indicatorType: .previous","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate back","    }","","    \/\/ List item with leading avatar, trailing text, and forward navigation","    let avatar = MISOListItemAvatar(type: .icon, size: .medium)","","    MISONavigationListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(label: \"Profile\", description: \"View your profile\"),","        leading: .avatar(avatar),","        trailing: .text(.labelMuted(Text(\"Details\")))","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to profile","    }","","    \/\/ List item with a custom view as trailing, e.g. a gauge showing a remaining SMS credit","    MISONavigationListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(label: \"SMS credit\"),","        trailing: .custom {","            MISOCircularProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","        }","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to SMS credit details","    }","","    \/\/ List item with slot (displayed under texts, before helper text)","    MISONavigationListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(","            label: \"Settings\",","            textSlot: { Text(\"Configure options\") },","            helperText: \"Helper text\"","        )","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to settings","    }","","    \/\/ List item with bottomSlot (displayed under main content, before helper text)","    MISONavigationListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(","            label: \"Profile\",","            bottomSlot: { Text(\"Additional info\") },","            helperText: \"Helper text\"","        )","    ) {","        \/\/ Navigate to profile","    }"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Leading elements","level":2,"anchor":"Leading-elements","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The leading position (before the texts) accepts one optional element via "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemLeading"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".icon(MIS